{{!-- One click-scale: the closed set of steps a rules table enumerates, laid
out as equal cells. Not a number input, because a spinner can be typed past the
end of the table and would be claiming a range the rules do not have.

Clicking the selected cell again clears the value — an unset band and a band
set to its lowest step are different answers, and this is the only way back to
the first one.

Called as {{> item-scale cells=scales.dk key='dk'}}. --}}
<div class='gear-ctl scale' role='radiogroup'>
  {{#each cells}}
    <button
      type='button'
      class='scale-cell'
      data-scale='{{../key}}'
      data-value='{{this.value}}'
      aria-checked='{{this.selected}}'
      role='radio'
      tabindex='0'
    >{{this.value}}</button>
  {{/each}}
</div>
